OL,3,GNEWSAWill the Chancellor help the
OL,4,ASouth's housing market?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe housing market is always an
OL,7,Findication of the state of the economy
OL,8,Fand one sector which can feature in a
OL,9,FChancellor's budget.
OL,11,FIt's expected that John Healey will
OL,12,Fconfirm the "Your First Home" scheme,
OL,13,Fwhich enables people to buy a new-build
OL,14,Fhome with a 2.5% deposit and a 20%
OL,15,Fequity loan.
OL,17,FBut the majority of sales in the South
OL,18,Fare second hand homes.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,334,330,200,160,0,100
