OL,3,GNEWSAWill the Chancellor help the
OL,4,ASouth's housing market?
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs the average price of a house in the
OL,7,FSouth East starts to rise again after
OL,8,Ffalling earlier in the year - 0.9%
OL,9,Fmonth on month in October according to
OL,10,Fproperty website Rightmove - what can
OL,11,Fbe done to keep up the momentum?
